{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-342d514cbf79","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-342d514cbf79","name":"酸梅汤（半成品加工）","category":"drink","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/drink/%E9%85%B8%E6%A2%85%E6%B1%A4%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%8A%E6%88%90%E5%93%81%E5%8A%A0%E5%B7%A5%EF%BC%89.md","blob_sha":"34d067f92941a8682667b3e13ed499a9c28e9830","details":{"introduction":"酸梅汤（半成品加工）是一道酸甜爽口的夏日消暑饮品，传统京味风格。酸梅汤本身有生津止渴、帮助消化的好处。做法极其简单，只需按顺序搅拌即可，对新手毫无难度，全程大约五分钟就能完成。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 酸梅晶固体饮料\n- 方糖（可选）\n- 北京二锅头酒（可选）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 饮用水 1177 克\n- 酸梅晶固体饮料 120 克\n- 方糖 9 克\n- 北京二锅头酒 48 克\n\n上述所有用量可以等比例增加或减小。"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 取饮用水 1177 克。\n2. 放入酸梅晶固体饮料 60 克，使用汤匙顺时针搅拌 50 圈。\n3. 再放入剩下 60 克酸梅晶固体饮料，再次使用汤匙顺时针搅拌 50 圈。\n4. 放入 9 克的方糖，使用汤匙顺时针搅拌 100 圈。\n5. 放入北京二锅头酒 48 克，用汤匙顺时针搅拌 30 圈。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"如果没有准备方糖或北京二锅头，可以省略操作中的第 4 步或第 5 步。\n\n放入冰箱冷藏后再饮用效果更佳。\n\n**饮酒请勿驾车。**"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"unknown","basis":null,"serving_g":null,"scope":null,"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":null,"protein_g":null,"carbohydrate_g":null,"fat_g":null},"source":null},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-342d514cbf79-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-342d514cbf79","recipe_blob_sha":"34d067f92941a8682667b3e13ed499a9c28e9830","version":"1","data_version":"7c3e300b3cdd3cd5","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","estimation_level":"food_group_proxy","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"同类食物代理粗估；2–3人家庭标准配方估算：白砂糖110g、通用西梅汁80g、通用40%vol无糖蒸馏酒40g、饮用水1080g；整份约1310g。酸梅晶按通用糖果味饮料模型近似：以糖100g和西梅汁80g代理粉料主要能量及果味，并将另加方糖按10g标准量计入；这不是酸梅晶真实配方或标签。白酒40g取通用40%vol无糖蒸馏酒代理，不冒充52度二锅头；水1080g，冷调整份1310g，所有液体直接称克。。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"identity_precision":"food_group_proxy","food_proxies":[{"target":"酸梅晶主要碳水","reference_name":"白砂糖","food":{"fdc_id":169655,"description":"Sugars, granulated","data_type":"SR Legacy","snapshot_sha256":"2be356829c925592a894d5ba45bd573eb5d8739be5ce9ad67ec5887e71e201cf"},"reason":"以明确糖100g作为粉料能量代理，比例为项目假设非厂家数据"},{"target":"酸梅晶果味成分","reference_name":"通用西梅汁","food":{"fdc_id":167753,"description":"Prune juice, canned","data_type":"SR Legacy","snapshot_sha256":"11193d1cc68f4932def094d5ab1e50a07f9df14c15cc70eadeb65f5e54170a2d"},"reason":"通用果汁代理，非原固体饮料标签"},{"target":"二锅头白酒","reference_name":"通用40%vol无糖蒸馏酒","food":{"fdc_id":174818,"description":"Alcoholic beverage, distilled, vodka, 80 proof","data_type":"SR Legacy","snapshot_sha256":"ad8d47a49ad51da275e9d5cb08700eda836f1912a9cc4572654ee2527774d743"},"reason":"40%vol通用蒸馏酒代理，原酒度不同时误差较大"}],"food_identity":"howtocook-342d514cbf79","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-342d514cbf79-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"sugar","grams":110},{"key":"prune_juice","grams":80},{"key":"generic_spirit","grams":40},{"key":"water","grams":1080}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":43.885496,"protein_g":0.037252,"carbohydrate_g":9.459542,"fat_g":0.001832},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients","version":"7c3e300b3cdd3cd5","fdc_ids":[169655,167753,174818,173647]},"rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","is_estimate":true,"requires_independent_match":true,"details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-342d514cbf79-v1.0134852af992f724.json","bytes":25616,"sha256":"0134852af992f7240770a962f582ce766598185cacfff90b47b2467af3a2a4e4"}}]}
